 / `uuidv7.toBytes(id)`, like `parse()`, accept any 128-bit UUID form regardless of version"],[145,"`uuidv4()`"],[410,"`uuidv5.DNS` / `uuidv5.URL`"],[691,"`uuidv5.DNS`, `uuidv5.URL`, `uuidv5.OID`, and `uuidv5.X500` are the RFC 9562 namespaces for domain names, URLs, ISO object identifiers, and X.500 distinguished names. Use them only for names of that kind."],[408,"`uuidv5(name, namespace, buf, offset)`"],[149,"`uuidv5(name, namespace)`"],[406,"`uuidv5(name, namespace)`"],[153,"`uuidv7()`"],[409,"`v5.DNS` / `v5.URL`"],[407,"`v5(name, namespace, buf, offset)`"],[405,"`v5(name, namespace)`"],[398,"`validate(id)`"],[441,"`VALUE_OUT_OF_RANGE`"],[639,"`VALUE_OUT_OF_RANGE`"],[400,"`version(id)`"],[325,"`withinActionRme` describes spread across repetitions in one CI action and\n`crossActionRme` describes spread across historical actions;"],[460,"`XID_MACHINE_ID_BYTES_TOO_SHORT`"],[442,"`XID_NON_CANONICAL`"],[458,"`XID_PROCESS_ID_OUT_OF_RANGE`"],[181,"`xid()`"],[573,"`xid`"],[577,"`xid`"],[637,"`xid`"],[372,"<Card title=\"Browse integrations\" href=\"/docs/guides/integrations\" description=\"Start with runnable Hono, Drizzle, and Effect examples.\" icon=\"<Blocks />\" />"],[370,"<Card title=\"Compare eleven strategies\" href=\"/docs/guides/choosing-an-id\" description=\"Choose a format by the job it needs to do.\" icon=\"<ScanLine />\" />"],[507,"<Card title=\"CUID v2\" href=\"/docs/reference/cuid-v2\" description=\"Non-sequential identifiers that resist enumeration.\" />"],[513,"<Card title=\"Errors\" href=\"/docs/reference/errors\" description=\"Typed errors and the generator list.\" />"],[369,"<Card title=\"Install uniku\" href=\"/docs/getting-started\" description=\"Generate your first ID in one import.\" icon=\"<PackageOpen />\" />"],[509,"<Card title=\"KSUID\" href=\"/docs/reference/ksuid\" description=\"High-entropy, time-ordered identifiers.\" />"],[374,"<Card title=\"Migrate to uniku\" href=\"/docs/migration/from-other-libraries\" description=\"Move from a familiar